Changes
-------

Paths below are the paths in the upstream repositories. Each package of the
copy keeps the layout of its upstream package.

2026-10-17: every Python file in `marker/`, `surya/`, and `pdftext/` that
imports another module of these three packages. The change rewrites the
import path from `marker.`, `surya.`, and `pdftext.` to `raw2md_engine.marker.`,
`raw2md_engine.surya.`, and `raw2md_engine.pdftext.`. The change also
rewrites the one module path that `marker/config/parser.py` holds in a
string. No other line changed.
